# E2E credentials — where they live (this machine).
#
# The smoke test loads credentials from two existing files rather than
# duplicating secrets. Source both before running, or use .e2e/load-env.sh.
#
# 1) R2 storage (bucket "umbral", already public):
#      /Users/rofi/conductor/workspaces/openwork/.env
#    provides: R2_ACCOUNT_ID R2_BUCKET R2_PUBLIC_BASE_URL
#              R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
#    Override the path with RN_DEPLOY_E2E_R2_ENV.
#
# 2) MacinCloud build host:
#      <repo>/aws-mac-vnc/.env
#    provides: MAC_VNC_HOST MAC_VNC_USER MAC_VNC_PASSWORD MAC_VNC_SSH_PORT
#    Override the path with RN_DEPLOY_E2E_MAC_ENV.
#
# The harness maps MAC_VNC_* -> the host block and R2_* -> the storage block.
#
# GitHub Actions case (optional): needs `gh` authed locally + the smoke repo
# (bidah/rn-deploy-smoke-app, public) with R2 secrets set. See PR description.
